 -------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 
 This is a log of changes that ncurses has gone through since Zeyd started
@@ -46,6 +46,15 @@
 Changes through 1.9.9e did not credit all contributions;
 it is not possible to add this information.
 
+20261114
+	+ review/fix teraterm special keys -TD
+	+ add kp5/kbeg to xterm+noapp (report by Jakub Horky)
+	+ add kbeg to linux-basic, konsole, terminology (patches by Jakub Horky)
+	+ add st-0.9.2 -TD
+	+ revise numeric keypad for iterm2, nsterm, mlterm -TD
+	+ make c++ binding's "operator=" private, since those do construct new
+	  copies (patch by Martin Mirchev). 
+
 20261107
 	+ check for terminating NUL in canonical_name() for infocmp -F
 	  (report/testcase by Martin Mirchev).
